  title: "HITL-IoT: A Reproducible Dataset and Benchmark for Studying Trustworthy Human-AI Collaboration, Oversight Mechanisms, and Selective Deferral in IoT Cybersecurity"
  journal: "BenchCouncil Transactions on Benchmarks, Standards and Evaluations"
  scope: "Accepted for publication; in copyediting. DOI, volume, issue, pages and publication year have not yet been confirmed."
